  aciklama:
  - "Fincan\u0131n\u0131n derin sular\u0131ndaki baz\u0131 telveler adeta bir \"dart
    tahtas\u0131\" \u015Feklini alm\u0131\u015F {{isim}}. G\xF6rd\xFC\u011F\xFCm
    kadar\u0131yla ge\xE7mi\u015Fte bu tahtaya belli bir ama\xE7 do\u011Frultusunda
    f\u0131rlat\u0131lan oklar, hedefi ve yak\u0131n \xE7evresini her seferinde \u0131skalam\u0131\u015F.
    Ne var ki, {{kelime, ge\xE7ti\u011Fimiz haftalarda | ge\xE7en ay | ge\xE7ti\u011Fimiz
    aylarda | son haftalarda | son aylarda}} at\u0131lm\u0131\u015F olan ba\u015Fka
    bir ok, hedefin merkez \xE7ap\u0131ndan \"3\" birim uza\u011Fa saplanm\u0131\u015F
    g\xF6r\xFCn\xFCyor. Yak\u0131n say\u0131labilecek bir tarihte kariyerinin gelece\u011Fini
    de\u011Fi\u015Ftirebilecek {{kelime, bir karar alm\u0131\u015Fs\u0131n | bir
    giri\u015Fim i\xE7in kollar\u0131 s\u0131vam\u0131\u015Fs\u0131n | bir g\xF6r\xFC\u015Fme
    yapm\u0131\u015Fs\u0131n | baz\u0131 insanlarla irtibat kurmu\u015Fsun}}. Bunu
    yaparken, getirece\u011Fi b\xFCy\xFCk sonu\xE7lar\u0131 \xF6ng\xF6rememi\u015F
    olman gayet normal. Bu sonu\xE7lar\u0131, 3 ay sonra, yani {{ay_3}} ay\u0131n\u0131n
    {{kelime, ilk haftalar\u0131nda | ilk \xE7eyre\u011Finde | ikinci \xE7eyre\u011Finde
    | \xFC\xE7\xFCnc\xFC \xE7eyre\u011Finde | son \xE7eyre\u011Finde | d\xF6rd\xFCnc\xFC
    \xE7eyre\u011Finde | 13'\xFC ya da 23'\xFCnde | 3'\xFC ya da 13'\xFCnde}} b\xFCt\xFCn\xFCyle
    g\xF6rmeye ba\u015Flayacaks\u0131n."
